  "description": "This dataset contains the densities (in fmol/mg protein) of receptors for classical neurotransmitters in stratum moleculare of CA (Hippocampus) obtained by means of quantitative _in vitro_ autoradiography. The receptor densities are visualized as _fingerprints_ (**fp**), which provide the mean density and standard deviation for each of the analyzed receptor types, averaged across samples. Information on the used tissue samples and corresponding subjects, as well as analyzed receptors accompanies the provided dataset.",
